# FLOWX n type low period   (a random node: 0 boolean, 1 byte, 2 integer, 3 float)
MFLOW 2
NAME Fluff silo system
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Screw01 empties the silo into the funnel;\nBlower01 blows the fluff up the riser to the\ncyclone on the silo roof (a loop), and part of\nit goes on to the consumer.\nEach motor drives a real part: stop or fault\nit and that part stops.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Double-click Blower01: it stops (grey) and\nso does the air; Screw01 stops the silo.\nSelect a motor and press Fault: it turns red.\nShow the hidden layer "Silo core" (F6).

